Upstream-Name: Tincan
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/martinsaul/tincan/issues
Source: https://github.com/martinsaul/tincan
Comment:
 The tincan binary statically links pjproject 2.17 (built from the pinned
 upstream tarball) and the pjproject-bundled codecs listed below. Shared
 libraries (Qt 6, QtKeychain, libopus, libsrtp2, OpenSSL, SQLite, ALSA,
 libuuid) come from their own Debian packages. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md in
 this directory for versions and upstream URLs.

